summary:
  A single playback error asks the directory at once, without one more open of
  the saved address.

history:
  Until 2026.43 the heal asked the directory two and a half seconds after any
  one error. An encoder restarting was enough: for a row with a uuid or its
  own domain the first candidate that buffered was written over the saved
  address, and a 320 kb/s row became its 96 kb/s mount for good. The saved
  address gets one more open first.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
